<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.AFRICAN POLICE ARREST GERMAN FOR EXTRADITION.</title>
<headline>S.AFRICAN POLICE ARREST GERMAN FOR EXTRADITION.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African police said on Friday they had arrested German citizen Hans Fritz Lawrenz for extradition to Germany where he is wanted on tax evasion charges.</p>
<p>A statement said Lawrenz was arrested in the Cape Province hamlet of Botriver on Thursday. It said the tax evasion charges were believed to involve an amount of 12 million marks.</p>
